1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,096
This leads to an important idea.

2
00:00:02,096 --> 00:00:13,333
A reversible process is one that can be made to retrace its path exactly, so that both the system and its surroundings return to where they started, leaving no trace anywhere.

3
00:00:13,333 --> 00:00:17,395
Any process that cannot do that is irreversible.

